    - name: Bob joins in this app
      do: As Bob, open this app with the invitation's code.
      expect: Bob's app joins Alice's space and opens its diagram
    - name: Drawing together
      do: As Alice, draw a rectangle in Composer; as Bob, draw an ellipse here.
      expect: both shapes show in both apps, and each sees the other's cursor and avatar
    - name: Bob follows Alice
      do: As Bob, click Alice's avatar and Follow; as Alice, pan and zoom the diagram in Composer.
      expect: Bob's canvas keeps Alice's camera, and his pill takes the follow's wash
    - name: Alice opens the document
      do: As Alice, open the document; as Bob, click Alice's avatar, then Stop.
      expect: Bob stays on the diagram and his follow shows Paused until he stops it
    - name: Alice follows Bob
      do: As Alice, open the diagram, click Bob's avatar on its plank and Follow; as Bob, pan and zoom.
      expect: Alice's Composer plank keeps Bob's camera, and its heading takes the follow's wash
```

