```mdl
decision D-30: Presence uses Composer's `viewing` protocol (post every 30 s, drop a viewer after 60 s), shown with the space plugin's `FullPresence`, which the space plugin now exports. Cursors are the canvas plugin's awareness cursors in the 2D article. Fills in [D-22].
  date: 2026-11-14
  by: agent:claude-code
