  why: Composer users viewing the same diagram then show here, and app users show in Composer.
```

```mdl
decision D-31: The path is `/<space id>/<diagram id>`. Choosing a space or diagram pushes a history entry; a correction (no diagram named, a deleted diagram) replaces it. The invitation stays a query parameter, and a URL whose space is not in this browser falls back to the last space with a toast. Fills in [D-24].
  date: 2026-11-14
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-8]
