```mdl
decision D-32: The diagram menu is react-ui's `Combobox` with a button trigger and its search field. A row's subtitle is "Edited" and the latest change time of the drawing or its canvas. A typed name that matches none offers New diagram with that name. Duplicate, Download .dx.svg and the editor's name ("by Ada") are left out. Fills in [D-25].
