decision D-126: Each environment is its own assets-only Worker, `diagram-<env>`, served from `diagram-<env>.dxos.workers.dev` until the app has a domain, and built with the environment file Composer's deploy reads: dev against EDGE preview, preview and staging against EDGE production. Preview deploys daily from `main` with the other preview apps; dev and staging deploy on dispatch. There is no production environment yet. Fills in [D-125].
