```mdl
decision D-128: A client that fails to initialize or times out shows the same dialog, replacing the boot shell, since the error boundary never sees a failure the client plugin catches. The dialog offers Reload, Reset, the error and its stack, and a copy of both. Safe mode, the recovery page, the log download and the crash report stay Composer's and reach the shared dialog as optional handlers, each adding its button. Fills in [D-127].
