```mdl
decision D-150: The production Worker is `drawing-app`, the Worker that serves app.drawing.sh today, and every other environment's Worker is `drawing-app-<env>`. Each environment's Worker declares its hosts as custom domains and binds a shares bucket and a rate limiter. This replaces the per-environment Workers of [D-126]. Fills in [D-147] and [D-148].
