decision D-160: Astro builds the site into a `site/` folder of the app's build output, after the app's Vite build, in the same bundle task. On a landing host the Worker serves the site's pages and files from that folder, under their own paths. The custom home page is at `/`, built from the old landing page's markup, styles and scripts. The splash page is at `/splash/`, with the same editor embedded. The docs sidebar and both home pages link to the app and the docs. Fills in [D-159].
